{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItems\">Inventory Items</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transactions\">Transactions</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customer InventoryItem Is Item On Pending To ToDate\">This screen displays all pending deliveries for a specific <em>inventory item</em> and <em>customer</em> combination.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Custom Customer Delivered HasWhere On To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">It shows transactions where inventory has been committed to a customer but not yet physically delivered, helping you track outstanding delivery obligations.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And By Credit CreditNote CreditNotes Date DeliveryNote DeliveryNotes Edit Invoice Invoices Is Notes On Pending Sales SalesInvoice SalesInvoices Transaction Transactions\">The list includes <em>Delivery Notes</em>, <em>Sales Invoices</em>, and <em>Credit Notes</em> that have quantities pending delivery. Transactions are sorted by date with the most recent appearing first.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Date On Pending Transaction\">Shows the transaction date for each pending delivery. Future dates may indicate scheduled deliveries that are not yet due.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transaction\">Transaction</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transaction\">Transaction</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Create Credit CreditNote DeliveryNote Edit Invoice Is On Sales SalesInvoice Transaction Type\">Displays the type of transaction (e.g., <em>Sales Invoice</em>, <em>Delivery Note</em>, <em>Credit Note</em>) that created the delivery obligation.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Edit On Reference To ToDate Transaction View\">Shows the reference number of the transaction. Click to open the original transaction for viewing or editing.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Column InventoryItem Is Item On Pending To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">Shows the <em>inventory item</em> that is pending delivery. This column may be hidden when viewing transactions for a specific item.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Column Custom Customer Is Item On To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">Shows the <em>customer</em> who is awaiting delivery of the items. This column may be hidden when viewing transactions for a specific customer.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Description On Transaction\">Shows the overall description entered for the transaction, providing context about the sale or delivery.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"LineDescription\">Line description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"LineDescription\">Line description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Add Delivered Description From FromDate Item Line On To ToDate Transaction\">Shows the specific line item description from the transaction, which may include additional details about the items to be delivered.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Is Item On Pending Transaction\">Displays the quantity of items still pending delivery for each transaction.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Column Delivered On To ToDate Total\">The <em>running total</em> column shows the cumulative quantity to be delivered, helping you track the total outstanding delivery obligations at any point in time.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "inventory-item-qty-to-deliver-transactions"
}
